    {
      "question": "May these settings be compared with the leaderboard? (the difficulty a caller passes)",
      "owner": "why_not_comparable in src/app/dm_report.cpp",
      "owner_file": "src/app/dm_report.cpp",
      "owner_symbol": "why_not_comparable",
      "date": "2026-10-11",
      "decision": "D114 item 6 (concept audit M17)",
      "added_by": "concept-F6",
      "pattern": "why_not_comparable\\(\\s*Difficulty::Expert",
      "must_match": [
        "why_not_comparable(Difficulty::Expert, kCloneHeroSpCap, lens.legacy_fills != 0,"
      ],
      "must_not_match": [
        "const std::string refused = why_not_comparable(mode.difficulty(), kCloneHeroSpCap,",
        "app::dm_report::why_not_comparable(app.settings.difficulty(), app.settings.sp_cap,"
      ],
      "note": "A caller that hands the gate a literal Expert instead of the difficulty it was given. collect_dm_rows did, so the comparison window's Refresh built a Hard page the toolbar refuses."
    },
    {
      "question": "Is this SP cap Clone Hero's rule?",
      "owner": "is_clone_hero_cap in src/core/model.h",
      "owner_file": "src/core/model.h",
      "owner_symbol": "is_clone_hero_cap",
      "date": "2026-10-11",
      "decision": "concept audit M17, second half (code-only)",
      "added_by": "concept-F6",
      "pattern": "[!=]=\\s*kCloneHeroSpCap\\b|\\bkCloneHeroSpCap\\s*[!=]=",
      "owner_files": [
        "src/core/model.h"
      ],
      "must_match": [
        "(s.sp_cap == kCloneHeroSpCap ? \" (Clone Hero's rule)\" : \" (a what-if)\");",
        "if (sp_cap != kCloneHeroSpCap)"
      ],
      "must_not_match": [
        "inline constexpr int kCloneHeroSpCap = 4;",
        "report::records_by_hash(store, chartmode, store::CapQuery::at(kCloneHeroSpCap), lens);",
        "if (!is_clone_hero_cap(sp_cap))"
      ],
      "note": "A cap compared with Clone Hero's by hand. The batch confirm's \"(a what-if)\" and the leaderboard gate each did."
    },
    {
